The confirmation dialog's "Shut down" and "Restart" go through logind
(org.freedesktop.login1.Manager PowerOff/Reboot), which FreeBSD has not:
the call failed quietly and nothing happened. On FreeBSD run shutdown(8)
instead, which root and the operator group may (the JuanitOS installer
puts its user there). Applied to cosmic-osd by tools/dev/cosmic-build.sh
patch.
